#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:5
msgid "沿着最陡方向下山"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:7
msgid "想象你在山上迷路了，想要下到山谷："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:9
msgid "**当前位置**：参数当前值 $\\theta_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:10
msgid "**最陡下降方向**：负梯度方向（你脚下最陡的下坡方向）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:11
msgid "**步长**：学习率 $\\eta$（你每一步迈多大）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:12
msgid "**目标**：到达山谷最低点（损失 $L$ 最小）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:14
msgid "神经网络训练转化为优化问题后，我们需要找到损失函数的**最小值点**。梯度下降（Gradient Descent）就是解决这个问题的迭代算法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:16
msgid "**核心思想**：在当前位置，沿着**梯度下降方向**（损失减小最快的方向）迈出一小步。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta_{t+1} = \\theta_t - \\eta \\cdot \\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:22
msgid "其中 $\\eta$ 是**学习率**（步长），$\\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta)$ 是损失函数对参数的梯度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:25
