msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:159
msgid "**全局最优**：最深的山谷（最优解）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:160
msgid "**鞍点**：马鞍形状的点（高维空间中非常常见）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:163
msgid "Loss Landscape：局部最优 vs 全局最优"
msgstr ""

