msgid "**关键观察**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:202
msgid "全局最优比局部最优**明显更深**（红色点远低于橙色点）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:203
msgid "两个最优之间由**鞍点**（紫色）分隔"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:204
msgid "优化算法需要\"翻过\"鞍点才能从局部最优到达全局最优"
