#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:206
msgid "**鞍点的详细展示**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:208
msgid "鞍点像一个马鞍——沿一个方向是极小值，沿另一个方向是极大值："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:211
msgid "鞍点：马鞍形状"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:241
msgid "**深度学习的特殊情况**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:243
msgid "高维空间中，**鞍点比局部最优更常见**"
