#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:245
msgid "现代网络通常能找到足够好的解，即使不是全局最优"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:247
msgid "动量法：积累速度翻越障碍"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:249
msgid "**直觉**：想象滚雪球下山，球会积累动量，越滚越快，同时可以滚过小的坑洼。在 loss landscape 中，动量帮助我们冲过鞍点和平坦区域。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:251
msgid "**原理**：引入速度变量，累积历史梯度："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:253
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"v_{t+1} &= \\gamma v_t + \\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta_t) \\\\\n"
"\\theta_{t+1} &= \\theta_t - \\eta \\cdot v_{t+1}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:260
msgid "**逐步理解动量法**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:262
msgid "**第一步：理解速度变量 $v_t$**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:264
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在基础 SGD 中，我们直接用梯度更新参数： $$\\theta_{t+1} = \\theta_t - \\eta \\cdot "
"\\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta_t)$$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:267
msgid "这相当于每走一步都**完全重新决定方向**，没有记忆之前走过的路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:269
msgid "动量法引入速度变量 $v_t$，相当于给优化过程添加了\"记忆\"——记住之前累积的运动趋势。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:271
msgid "**第二步：解读速度更新公式**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:273
#, python-brace-format
msgid "v_{t+1} = \\gamma v_t + \\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta_t)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:275
msgid "这行公式的含义是：**新速度 = 保留的旧速度 + 当前梯度**"
msgstr ""

