#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:417
msgid "第 1 步：$m_1 = (1-\\beta_1) g_1$，比真实均值小了约 $(1-\\beta_1)$ 倍"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:418
msgid "第 2 步：$m_2 = \\beta_1(1-\\beta_1)g_1 + (1-\\beta_1)g_2$，仍有偏差"
