#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:420
msgid "**修正原理**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:422
msgid "如果 $m_t$ 估计的是 $E[g]$，那 $E[m_t] = (1-\\beta_1^t) E[g]$"
