msgid "配合Warmup使用效果更佳"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:644
msgid "scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=100)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:648
msgid "4. 预热（Warmup）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:650
msgid "**问题**：训练初期参数随机初始化，梯度可能很大且不稳定，大学习率会导致震荡。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:652
msgid "**策略**：从很小的学习率开始，线性增加到目标学习率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:655
msgid "Warmup + Cosine Annealing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:674
msgid ""
"# 组合使用：Warmup + Cosine Annealing\n"
"scheduler1 = optim.lr_scheduler.LinearLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    start_factor=0.01,      # 从1%的目标学习率开始\n"
"    end_factor=1.0,\n"
"    total_iters=5           # 前5个epoch预热\n"
")\n"
"scheduler2 = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    T_max=95                # 剩余95个epoch余弦退火\n"
")\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.SequentialLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    schedulers=[scheduler1, scheduler2], \n"
"    milestones=[5]\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

